    "summary": "!!! info \"Generated\" Run worldarena build-docs --config config/datasets.yaml after adding, deleting, or reorganizing source assets. Summary The image corpus spans static scene frames and motion-labelled dynamic stills used by the image static and image dynamic benchmark suites. Panels below summarize inventory scale, taxonomy coverage, mask supervision, and applicable metrics before the detailed tables and interactive charts.",
